<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-10T01:41:02.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:41:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces struck the Saudi Aramco building in Riyadh, prompting Pakistan to demand an immediate halt to all Houthi attacks on Saudi Arabia. In Northwest Pakistan a police officer was killed in a terror attack, while the Baloch Army killed seven men it labelled Pakistani agents, including two minors, in Balochistan. The UN warned that 700 healthcare facilities are expected to close in Afghanistan, and Punjab officials linked regional smog to cross-border Diwali fireworks from India. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBNZzNQclRGYW16U1BnbUJVLUdobjVKX0stSHhnQl9obnZnYUdLMWFkaUlhSV9IbFlXaTQ1SVd1TjNlcHpPdXJKOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOSjhhZzlJeHBXWDRBRzY4SjB3eF8wUlRWS25YOGF4S0ZfemxqMm5nQmJhemhQXzNJcVdCVF9mcDQwX21xSnRmZHpVcWRJMmlLX1lvN2xLaFNFeXVSbHctbHVyQnZNZVE1ZkZLVElWeGVacmdmV3ZicDEwUzYxRHZENFVFenMyMU1NbVJmOVRGX0R0MTU5bkVnV3p2cjBUWjJkbjRLLWpaNXhUanFMS25uVjBleU_SAboBQVVfeXFMTkd1ZjRpcThWQ0ROQXdTSGoyOFVpZlplY25TbWhOOW55a2lablJVVE1rWGF0QVNndzBZanVzY3VfTEdpYlo2bktMWEV3MzFhN21qRjNTUF9oUjRSZHFLb2hJWTBvRWZFTmlfQ29Gc256cFJpUkhDOVhmd0dScVJ4TUhwVjN4UTB0MF9VWXprNGlvQkMxa0NJWThuakMyUjZ4R0RvSnZnLV9wTnJzYkdfeFhLVjNSZ1J5Mzln?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sportstar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQYkx1WUNqSDZhWUFSUHNSalV6R295ZTNWZzNtdmhrWUVpMzJuaVlqdUhjYXlxSUVTWkpwZWxYTUFEV0JvbUg5NkJDR1QwTTRhTGV3dGlneTA4Ynp5SkdXQk53RDZwTFBnekg2VXRJa0tVZ0xnaFJsWTFvQ1FMQlo1Mk5KdUZCOXBpX3QxOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pakistan Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Pioneer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?